{"headword": "highly", "meanings": [{"pos": "ad.", "ko": "매우, 대단히"}, {"pos": "ad.", "ko": "높이 평가하여"}], "meaning_ko": "매우", "example_en": "The new movie was highly recommended by many critics.", "example_ko": "그 새 영화는 많은 평론가들에게 매우 추천받았다."}
