{"headword": "glare", "meanings": [{"pos": "v.", "ko": "노려보다"}, {"pos": "n.", "ko": "눈부신 빛"}, {"pos": "n.", "ko": "노려봄"}], "meaning_ko": "노려보다", "example_en": "The teacher glared at the students who were talking during the test.", "example_ko": "선생님은 시험 중에 떠드는 학생들을 노려보았다."}
